  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>GP</mi><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>ar</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Now, given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>ar</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ar</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mtext>Since</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>GP</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>is not constant so </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> is rejected</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>18</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>18</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>18</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>18</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>18</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>18</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup></math></p>"
